      "evidence": "No rate limiting on /imports or /upload endpoints.",
      "llm_reasoning": "The application is vulnerable to brute-force or DoS attacks by flooding the git clone or file upload endpoints.",
      "suggested_fix": "Implement express-rate-limit middleware."
